---
source: crates/decoy-tui/src/ui.rs
expression: "after(&[\"/help\"], |_| {})"
---
› /help
  /collection <id>                 switch the active Session's Collection
  /route <route:case:behavior>     override one Route's Case in the active Session
  /reset                           clear the active Session's overrides, keep its Collection
  /session <id>                    switch the Session commands target
  /sessions                        list the Sessions that hold a Selection
  /status                          show the active Session's Collection and overrides
  /help                            list commands and keys
  /quit                            stop the server and exit
  keys: ↑↓ pick · Tab/→ complete · Enter run · Esc close · ↑↓ history (no popup)
        PgUp/PgDn/Home/End or wheel scroll · drag select + copy · Shift+drag terminal selection
        Ctrl+U clear line · Ctrl+C clear, twice quits · Ctrl+D quit on empty input




╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│› type / for commands                                                                             │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
 http://127.0.0.1:4010 · session default · collection happy-path · 0 overrides
